WEBVTT

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:08.100
When it happened,
I was wrapped in light...

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:14.030
and I became a fragment of the light,
falling into a distant horizon.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.390
With someone close by my side...

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:24.740
I fly to a land beyond dimensions.

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:47.110
Who's there? Where are you?

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:56.770
The Dragon shall sleep.

00:01:00.430 --> 00:01:02.290
What's wrong?

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:05.490
They're the dragon soldiers.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.240
Where is this?

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:08.950
The Dragon shall sleep.

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.610
This land is La'cryma.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:14.510
A land in a different position
from your dimension.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:16.500
The Dragon shall sleep.

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.250
La'cryma?

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:20.740
- The Dragon shall sleep.
- Give it up, Karasu.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:27.520
No! I will not surrender Haruka!

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:30.230
Capture him!

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:43.950
The Dragon shall sleep.

00:01:45.640 --> 00:01:47.530
Karasu!

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:05.730
At the silver sky, the endless sky

00:02:06.070 --> 00:02:12.060
I gazed together with you, without a word

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:18.240
Touching your back, with trembling fingers

00:02:18.430 --> 00:02:23.670
I quietly ponder, as your profile looks up

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:29.710
I want to assure your smile, and the future ahead of you

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:36.050
Just standing and crying, I want to erase myself away

00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:41.930
As I extend my hands, it is almost within my reach

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:47.980
This is no fantasy, possibilities are perhaps right by my side

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:53.820
Changing every sorrow into strength

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:59.990
Let's throw all limitations into the end of time

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:03.180
Just keeping you as my aspirations

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:08.330
Even in the driving wind

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:15.270
I'll still be pushing on ahead

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:20.930
Misekku kesta

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:28.850
Fortune. Will you save it for me, dear?

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:43.260
Apparently the Dragon Torque is secured?

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:48.450
We certainly did not expect a high density
R E I Z U elementary aggregate particle...

00:03:49.030 --> 00:03:51.370
to be in the guise of a young girl.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:56.270
It is impossible to fully predict
different dimensions.

00:03:56.270 --> 00:03:59.170
The invasion of Shangri-la is not logical.

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:00.910
That's an excuse.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:06.080
They twist dimensions,
like the invasion of a savage tribe.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:11.800
Anyway, now the erosion of Shangri-la...

00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:14.550
can be prevented, correct?

00:04:14.550 --> 00:04:18.260
If we incorporate the Dragon Torque
into the R E I Z U simulator...

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:22.390
That is also no more than a hypothesis.

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:23.770
Enough.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:28.120
We're being tested.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:32.620
...for the significance of the existence
of mankind in this universe.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:38.530
Will we be recognized
by the absolute observer?

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.600
Or...

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:48.620
She disappeared.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.790
Right before my eyes.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:54.300
Light suddenly appeared all around her.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.800
Yuu...

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:02.270
She disappeared
right before our eyes too!

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:05.610
Hey, was she really with
the guy in the black cape?

00:05:05.610 --> 00:05:07.570
He's the one who took her!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:10.850
Yuu...

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:14.550
Pull yourself together, Goto!
Did Haruka really disappear?

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:17.420
Or was she taken by somebody?!

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.120
Yeah...

00:05:20.420 --> 00:05:23.920
It's... It's all my fault.

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:27.630
Yuu, it's not your fault.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:29.900
At any rate, let's have another look!

00:05:29.900 --> 00:05:30.730
Yeah.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:33.000
Shall we consult with Yukie-chan?

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.070
Yukie-chan? Do you think
she'll believe us?

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:39.370
Yeah! Why not!
Let's call up Yukie-chan!

00:05:39.370 --> 00:05:42.380
We haven't seen her
since summer break began!

00:05:42.380 --> 00:05:44.640
What are you so happy about?

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:48.080
Fujiwara, aren't you
worried about Haruka?!

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.720
Of... Of course I'm worried!

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:52.350
Then what're you blushing for?!

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:53.860
Like a testosterone charged chimp!

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.620
What did you call me, Mukai?!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.230
Testosterone charged,
like an animal in heat.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:01.430
I am not lusting!
You're impossible!

00:06:01.430 --> 00:06:02.590
It's that boy.

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:03.870
- You're in heat! You're in heat!
- Impossible!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:07.340
You just wanna use Haruka as
an excuse to see Yukie-chan!

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:08.500
Yeah! That's right!

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.770
I... I do not!

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:11.660
Goto-kun!

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:14.810
Would you please have
a look at this photo?

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.480
Haruka?!

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:19.510
Where is Haruka-chan right now?

00:06:19.510 --> 00:06:20.780
Who the heck are you?

00:06:20.780 --> 00:06:23.240
If you know anything, please tell me.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:26.620
She disappeared.

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:28.450
Disappeared?

00:06:31.760 --> 00:06:34.290
We could be too late.

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:40.540
If she moved through dimensions
wrapped in the foam of Wheeler...

00:06:40.540 --> 00:06:42.300
What would happen?

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:45.950
She may not be able
to come back to this world.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:55.220
Huh? I wonder where this is?

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:07.730
What?

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:10.990
What are you doing?! Stop it!

00:07:18.110 --> 00:07:20.580
Blood pressure 107 over 66.

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:23.740
Respiration 14. Pulse rate 82.

00:07:23.740 --> 00:07:26.170
Temperature 36.7.

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:30.210
All vital signs are normal.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.550
Her existence is stable, Amamiku-sama.

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:41.720
Your parents will be sad
if you kidnap people!

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:47.240
You have come to La'cryma
from a dimension in the past.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:48.980
Past?

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:52.810
From your perspective,
this is a future world.

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:55.990
Future? What are you talking about?!
Where am I?

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.360
La'cryma.

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:03.310
That is what we call this dimension.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.410
He said the same thing.

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:08.700
Where is he? Where is Karasu?

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.450
Well, Karasu is...

00:08:26.870 --> 00:08:30.040
I didn't expect you to sink
into the darkness of chaos.

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:33.240
I talked the Shudoh Group
out of your extermination.

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.940
Where is Haruka?

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:38.550
Snap out of it, Karasu!

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:42.940
No matter how it resembles your past,
that world does not exist!

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:45.130
You're wrong.

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:47.890
I'm not wrong! Don't get confused!

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:51.930
Don't kill Haruka.

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:58.930
You killed Isuka, didn't you.

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:01.730
Isuka...

00:09:02.410 --> 00:09:04.510
We also lost Tobi and Atori.

00:09:04.510 --> 00:09:08.480
They betrayed us to remain
in that dimension.

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:10.440
Betrayed?

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:13.940
I need your power, Karasu!

00:09:15.690 --> 00:09:20.580
I'm sure you realize that dimension
is different from the one of our past.

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:24.460
We are given the power...

00:09:25.600 --> 00:09:28.160
to establish our existence!

00:09:31.810 --> 00:09:34.510
Excuse me?! Hey, are you that...

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:35.910
Your name is Uchida, right?

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:39.110
Yes. Teacher, I know
I've said this many times...

00:09:39.110 --> 00:09:42.850
but we saw the same phenomenon
witnessed by these children.

00:09:42.850 --> 00:09:46.480
Kooriyama-san's police handbook
appears to be the real thing...

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:49.650
but what is a scientist and
a policeman doing together?

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:54.660
I told you! There's no way I can explain
myself to a school teacher like you!

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:57.030
Hey, what do you mean by "like me"?!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.000
Yukie-chan, no fighting.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.870
There, there, ladies.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.830
We're all adults here,
so let's calm down...

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:04.280
What?!

00:10:05.610 --> 00:10:08.110
S... Scary. This is impossible.

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.370
Your meal.

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:32.970
R... Right.

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:42.010
This is food?

00:10:42.010 --> 00:10:43.670
Yes.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.540
It's actually pretty tasty.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:04.850
Is this place really the future?

00:11:06.670 --> 00:11:08.300
If this is the future...

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:12.340
won't history be changed
by bringing me here?

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:14.650
It won't change our dimension.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.140
Dimension?

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:19.680
Yes. Dimensions diverge into infinity.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:21.020
Diverge?

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:24.740
I'm saying that the dimension
in which you exist...

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:28.680
...also has dimensions,
horizontally aligned into infinity.

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:33.950
Even if you were to remain here...

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:38.360
Only one of you would disappear
from one dimension.

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:43.000
All your other selves in the other
dimensions will continue to exist.

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:48.220
That's why dimensions flow smoothly
from the past to the future.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:53.230
Even if I'm gone...
nothing would change?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:57.430
No. With your presence here...

00:11:59.050 --> 00:12:02.890
it will be possible
to change our future.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:09.410
Tobi, I feel totally weak.

00:12:10.970 --> 00:12:14.700
Can't help it.
We released our pipelines.

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:16.070
Huh?

00:12:16.070 --> 00:12:18.510
Cutting ourselves off the pipeline...

00:12:18.510 --> 00:12:22.500
makes them unable to secure
our positions from La'cryma...

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.980
but it also prevents them from sending
us the existence extension data.

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:31.630
That's why our existences can't
be stabilized in this dimension.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:36.720
And since we have an unstable
existence in this dimension...

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:39.250
we could eventually disappear.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.600
How long will we last?

00:12:41.600 --> 00:12:44.670
I dunno. Even I can't tell.

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.620
You're useless.

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:52.940
But I think that wouldn't be so bad.

00:12:52.940 --> 00:12:54.160
What do you mean?

00:12:54.780 --> 00:12:59.480
It wouldn't be so bad to disappear
in such a peaceful dimension.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:01.170
Heh, don't be stupid!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:06.750
I haven't fought enough yet.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:09.660
Bring 'em on, and I'll destroy them.

00:13:09.660 --> 00:13:13.890
Before I disappear,
I'll destroy everything.

00:13:19.170 --> 00:13:21.800
Um... Who is she?

00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:24.190
Did you call her Amamiku?

00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:29.440
So rude! Like I don't exist.

00:13:39.520 --> 00:13:41.650
It hurts...

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:44.160
Wh... What happened?

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:46.370
It hurts...

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:49.830
What are you doing?!

00:13:52.400 --> 00:13:54.290
Hold it right there!

00:13:55.670 --> 00:13:58.060
Open the door! Open this door!

00:14:23.130 --> 00:14:25.700
This damn place isn't the future!

00:14:25.700 --> 00:14:28.120
They think they can fool me
'cause I'm only a kid!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:54.580
Maybe it's up.

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.920
Huh?

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:10.840
What is this room for?

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.820
You don't look familiar.

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:50.050
Oh, I'm new here.

00:15:51.150 --> 00:15:55.630
That's funny. Have we met
somewhere before?

00:15:55.630 --> 00:15:57.920
No! Never!

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.630
A mini Miho?

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:05.370
I'm Lily!! My mom is Miho!

00:16:05.370 --> 00:16:07.840
- Huh?
- Who in the world are you?

00:16:07.840 --> 00:16:10.330
Strange! Strange! Strange!!

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.340
The clouds are moving.

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:20.190
Rain's a-coming.
Rain's gonna pour on down!

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:23.880
It's gonna rain,
it's gonna rain, it's gonna rain!

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.590
Splish-splash, splish-splash! La-la-la!

00:16:25.590 --> 00:16:29.390
Well, I guess you're
not the only weirdo here.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:34.760
Say, is there anywhere I can get
a drink of water? I'm thirsty.

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:38.210
Don't you even know that?

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:42.220
I have no excuse, Amamiku-sama.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:49.890
Amamiku.

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:54.350
The duty for which you
were bequeathed that name...

00:16:54.350 --> 00:16:57.850
You must fulfill your responsibility.

00:16:57.850 --> 00:16:59.290
I am aware of that.

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:01.620
Bring her back immediately.

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:04.730
The failure must not be made twice.

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:06.240
I understand.

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:10.990
I do not want to alter
the Dragon Torque set-up time.

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:13.370
Do you understand?

00:17:13.370 --> 00:17:15.060
Yes.

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:22.540
I'm surprised she got away.

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:26.770
She couldn't go that far.

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:29.080
Are you sure?

00:17:29.080 --> 00:17:33.110
Were you surprised
when you saw The Dragon Torque?

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:38.330
Karasu is confused.

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:39.870
And you?

00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:43.160
Me? I don't know.

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.500
Huh?

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:49.490
Just kidding. To me,
La'cryma is the only reality.

00:17:49.900 --> 00:17:51.940
I see.

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:55.760
Fukuro, please. I want to be the one
to bring the Dragon Torque back!

00:17:56.210 --> 00:17:59.980
If I don't do something,
I'll be banished to the upper strata.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:07.520
Oh, all right. Okay,
I'll contact you when I spot her.

00:18:09.790 --> 00:18:11.100
I'm sorry.

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:14.630
I'm a real bitch, aren't I.

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:16.860
No, you're not.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:20.960
You've always been a great gal.

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:47.600
Say, this place is underground, right?

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.760
What else would it be?!

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:52.100
Okay, so do you know
a way to get to the surface?

00:18:52.100 --> 00:18:54.330
You're kidding, right?
Do you want to die?

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:54.980
Huh?

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.840
Don't you know that monsters
will come attacking?

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:58.940
Monsters?

00:18:59.210 --> 00:19:03.440
That's right! When the
Uroboros appears in the sky...

00:19:03.440 --> 00:19:07.780
the monsters will come
and swallow up our world!

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:17.200
Hey, it's a dragon soldier.

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:20.190
It's unusual for them to come here.

00:19:20.190 --> 00:19:23.830
Hey, Lily? Please, I want to make sure.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.960
Tell me how to get to the surface.

00:19:26.230 --> 00:19:27.270
For real?

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:29.030
For real.

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:31.870
You really are stupid.

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:32.840
How come?

00:19:32.840 --> 00:19:36.710
After all, you can't use the transporter,
right? That's what you normally use...

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:37.710
Transporter?

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:41.750
Ugh, you're so frustrating!
You transform your body into Reizu!

00:19:41.750 --> 00:19:46.400
Forget it! I don't really understand.
Isn't there another way?

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:49.690
What? Wait a minute...

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:52.580
Come to think of it, the old man with
the umbrella once mentioned something.

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:54.750
What, what?

00:20:09.940 --> 00:20:11.690
Hey, don't look down!

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:15.480
Why do I have to come with you?!

00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.290
You're the one who wanted to come
'cause you said it sounded like fun!

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:20.690
I take it back! I'm going back!

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:25.290
You can't! It's too late
to turn back now!

00:20:26.560 --> 00:20:30.700
Crying will only make you fall!
Now come on! Show some guts!

00:20:30.700 --> 00:20:33.710
Mama, help me!

00:20:47.420 --> 00:20:48.450
Rain, rain...

00:20:48.450 --> 00:20:52.120
The old man saw someone resembling
the Dragon Torque near the ventilation duct.

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:53.480
What?!

00:20:54.050 --> 00:20:55.850
Don't tell me she's
going to the surface!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:06.800
This is the surface?

00:21:06.800 --> 00:21:08.620
I think so.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:20.240
But there's nothing here.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.010
Haruka?

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.630
Where are you going?! It's dangerous!

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:39.090
Where is this place?

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:52.840
Hold it.

00:21:57.420 --> 00:22:03.220
Don't bother trying to run.
There is no place for you here.

00:22:06.630 --> 00:22:10.040
Where is this?
Where have you brought me?

00:22:10.530 --> 00:22:12.850
I'm sure you have already
realized that for yourself.

00:22:18.540 --> 00:22:20.510
That can't be.

00:22:20.510 --> 00:22:21.820
It is.

00:22:22.510 --> 00:22:26.580
Now you know that this world
is the future.

00:22:26.580 --> 00:22:31.570
You're lying...

00:22:32.220 --> 00:22:34.280
I am Ai.

00:22:36.120 --> 00:22:39.530
Ai Amamiku Hasebe.

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:43.290
Hasebe Ai?

00:22:44.260 --> 00:22:45.970
No way!

00:22:45.970 --> 00:22:49.500
That can't possibly be right!
You're an adult!

00:22:50.270 --> 00:22:54.510
This is the world 15 years into
the future... from your perspective.

00:22:55.010 --> 00:22:59.470
15 years later?
This is our future?

00:23:02.450 --> 00:23:06.340
Why does the world 15 years
into the future look like this?

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:30.380
A sleepless night

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:34.270
The sound of the second hand

00:23:34.270 --> 00:23:41.200
The rumble of the
refrigerator in the air

00:23:42.100 --> 00:23:45.990
Just as the moon
through the blinds...

00:23:45.990 --> 00:23:49.900
Waxes and wanes, someday...

00:23:49.900 --> 00:23:56.490
The pain will change to warmth

00:23:56.490 --> 00:24:01.710
Boat of time...

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:06.960
No matter where it flows...

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:13.090
Most likely we'll meet again

00:24:13.090 --> 00:24:16.730
From scars come the
footsteps of dawn

00:24:16.730 --> 00:24:19.930
Rather than sighing,
they secretly...

00:24:19.930 --> 00:24:26.040
come pouring down
on every new day

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:30.580
No matter what sky it is

00:24:42.250 --> 00:24:45.090
I'm dreaming again.

00:24:45.090 --> 00:24:47.540
That summer day's dream.

00:24:48.450 --> 00:24:50.510
Haruka is dead.

00:24:54.130 --> 00:24:57.090
Will I ever see everybody again?

00:24:59.830 --> 00:25:03.070
I have to find Haruka.

00:25:03.970 --> 00:25:07.170
Next episode, Precious Person.

00:25:07.810 --> 00:25:09.970
Tell me the truth.
